%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Exotext_Introduction_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 342aebace168d574bbce4672df44c0a4, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 609198235648
    m_Localized: On the side of the original "Pure White Oath" sword, another faint
      sword shadow emerged. The two swords are born from the same source and can
      be held separately with both hands or combined into one. When separated, the
      sword in the left hand is lighter, while the sword in the right hand is heavier
      - the light one is "I'm sorry", and the heavy one is "It's okay".
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 616555044864
    m_Localized: "A long silver-white sword, its body adorned with faint thread patterns.
      When held in hand, one can feel the heartbeat of another. A small silver bell
      is embedded at the hilt\u2014it is a fragment of the Pure White Guide's \"Ming
      Si\"."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 622179606528
    m_Localized: A seemingly ordinary book with a pure white cover. When opened,
      there are no words inside - but when the protagonist recalls his memories with
      the pure white guide, those memories will automatically emerge as pictures
      and words on the pages. Each page represents a bond, and each line is a moment
      that cannot be forgotten.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 625241448448
    m_Localized: A magic staff with a tip made of star fragments, its body forged
      from solidified love. When wielded, it leaves a faint trail of star paths,
      as if writing in the void. When casting spells, words emerge from the tip that
      only the user can see - they are the verses the universe is whispering to him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1806151933952
    m_Localized: 'A small silver bell, entirely pure white, has delicate patterns
      engraved on its body - those are the heartbeat traces of someone. When it doesn''t
      ring, it''s silent; but when it does, it echoes the words that the pure white
      guide wanted to say at that time: words she never uttered, but were heard by
      the protagonist''s heart.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1810933440512
    m_Localized: A bow without a bowstring, its body formed from translucent thoughts.
      When used, one must draw a strand of thought from the depths of their heart
      and tie it to both ends of the bow - the length of the bowstring is equal to
      the length of the thought. At the moment of shooting, the thought turns into
      a visible thread, cutting through all obstacles and reaching its intended destination.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1813798150144
    m_Localized: Initially, it was just a faint, almost imperceptible glow, entwined
      around the protagonist's fingertips, impossible to grasp but never dissipating.
      It had no physical form and no offensive power, but it would slightly warm
      up when he felt the most lonely. In the final chapter, this glow transformed
      into countless light points, like a myriad of lights. Each light represented
      a person he remembered, a bond he cherished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1833314246656
    m_Localized: One sword is pure black, the other pure white. The black sword is
      heavy and slow, while the white sword is light and swift. Neither is complete
      when used alone; only when wielded together can one possess both heaviness
      and lightness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838561320960
    m_Localized: The sword blade is woven from countless fine and dense memory threads,
      each representing a cherished past event. When the sword is wielded, the threads
      quiver slightly, emitting a whisper that only the holder can hear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1841430224896
    m_Localized: A pen stemming from the same origin, akin to a sword with the same
      name but different forms. When used to write, every word penned becomes a memory,
      capable of being touched, seen, and cherished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1844089413632
    m_Localized: The staff is embedded with seven star cores, each representing a
      different emotion. When casting a spell, the seven star cores illuminate in
      sequence, akin to translating a seven-line poem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1848879308800
    m_Localized: The sword body is hollow, with seven small bells embedded inside.
      When the sword is wielded, the sound of the bells resonates with the heartbeat
      of nearby companions. The more people resonate, the sharper the sword becomes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1852721291264
    m_Localized: The bow is woven from countless intertwined threads of bonds, each
      thread originating from a genuine connection. When the bow is drawn, all those
      connected will feel a slight sensation - someone is thinking of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1856248700928
    m_Localized: A dissipating sword, its body covered in cracks. With each use,
      another crack appears. It is said that when the sword is filled with cracks,
      it will completely disappear. But the user says that at that time, it will
      reignite elsewhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1861709684736
    m_Localized: One sword is engraved with question marks, while the other is engraved
      with full stops. The sword with question marks is responsible for asking questions,
      while the sword with full stops is responsible for answering. Sometimes the
      sword with question marks takes the initiative, and sometimes the sword with
      full stops responds first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864591171584
    m_Localized: A nearly transparent sword emerges only when determination is set.
      The blade is extremely thin, so thin that it can cut through thoughts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1874540060672
    m_Localized: A scroll that can extend infinitely. Every time a memory is recorded,
      the scroll grows one inch. It is said that someone has recorded their entire
      life, and the length of the scroll is enough to encircle the singularity of
      the mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1877429936128
    m_Localized: The tip of the staff always shines with a faint light, like a lighthouse
      guiding ships at night. Users won't get lost in the darkness, as the light
      from the tip of the staff points to the nearest star.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1880290451456
    m_Localized: A bell that can ring out memories. When gently shaken, one can hear
      the voice of someone who has gone far away. The harder it is shaken, the clearer
      the voice becomes, but it also dissipates faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1882890919936
    m_Localized: A bow that always points in a certain direction. The owner of the
      bow points it towards home, shooting arrow after arrow day after day, but none
      of them ever reach their target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1885621411840
    m_Localized: It appears to be an ordinary wooden staff, with a stone no longer
      shining embedded at its tip. Yet, it remains perpetually warm, even in the
      coldest winter. Anyone who touches it will be reminded of someone who has departed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1890377752576
    m_Localized: The sword in the left hand is named "Retain", featuring a barbed
      blade that is difficult to extract once it has been stabbed; the sword in the
      right hand is named "Let Go", with a smooth blade that can be easily withdrawn
      with a single strike.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1894169403392
    m_Localized: A broken sword, with its tip nowhere to be found. Yet it remains
      sharp - for the sharpest are often the unspoken words.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1899915599872
    m_Localized: A tiny carving knife can etch memories onto any material. The carved
      stone speaks, the carved wind sings, and the carved person - will never be
      forgotten.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1905636630528
    m_Localized: A short and compact staff, with a childhood rhyme carved on its
      body. When casting spells, a chorus of children's voices will ring out, reminding
      those who hear it that they too were once children.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1908253876224
    m_Localized: A bell that can only be rung when it's pressed against your heart.
      When it rings, the hearts of all those nearby who share a bond with you will
      beat in sync.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1912045527040
    m_Localized: After being shot, the arrow will transform into thousands of paper
      cranes, each carrying a blessing. It does not harm people, but only heals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1914637606912
    m_Localized: A candle that has never been extinguished still has a white wick.
      Its owner has been waiting for a moment worth igniting. But after waiting for
      too long, they have forgotten what they were waiting for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1942961741824
    m_Localized: 'A nameless staff, as its owner has yet to find his or her own star.
      A small inscription is carved on the staff: "When you find that star, come
      and name me."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1940235444224
    m_Localized: A peculiar stone slab can "carve" memories that one wishes to forget.
      The moment it is carved, the memory disappears, and a scene emerges on the
      stone slab. However, the stone slab will become heavier and heavier until one
      day, the bearer can no longer walk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1936603176960
    m_Localized: A short sword, with "Hello" and "Goodbye" engraved on its blade.
      Every time the sword is drawn, it is a greeting; every time it is sheathed,
      it is a farewell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1931309965312
    m_Localized: Two identical swords, like mirror images. Only those who truly understand
      each other can wield them simultaneously - the swords will speak for their
      masters what they cannot say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10715671519232
    m_Localized: A bell that never rings. But its very existence is a kind of sound
      - the echo of "some words are never necessary to say".
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10734642356224
    m_Localized: A peculiar bow, whose arrows, upon hitting their target, will bounce
      back to the archer's hand, carrying back the heartbeat of the person struck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10738949906432
    m_Localized: Two intertwined glimmers of light originated from two people who
      made vows to each other. Their wishes were granted, and they both burned out
      at the moment they were fulfilled. Yet, the embers remained intertwined, never
      to be separated again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
